      "release_date": "2026-08-17",
      "release_notes": "Here are highlights of the fixes, changes, and improvements we've made since the last major release of Google Earth Pro:\n- Google Earth 10 KML compatibility improvements:\n  - Support for gx:CascadingStyle KML extension; KML features imported from Google Earth 10 retain styles like icons, line widths, and colors.\n  - Support for other extensions found in KML exported from Google Earth 10.\n- Fix for app launch issue on some recent Linux releases.\n- Measurement tool and property editor measurement tab use the same unit selection.\n- GeoTIFF imports or super overlays can be saved as KMZs that can be opened in Google Earth 10.\n- Other minor fixes and improvements.",
